{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29104","headline":"宣城崔大夫召联句偶疾不获赴因献 · 许浑","name":"宣城崔大夫召联句偶疾不获赴因献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"心慕知音命自拘，画堂闻欲试吹竽。\n茂陵罢酒慙中圣，漳浦题诗怯大巫。\n鬐鬣几年伤在藻，羽毛终日羡栖梧。\n还愁旅棹空归去，枫叶荷花钓五湖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29104.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29104","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}